hadiths[3]{hadithnumber,text}:
"17764","Yahya ibn Said narrated to us, from Sufyan, Mansur narrated to me, and Abd al-Rahman ibn Mahdi said: Sufyan and Zaida narrated to us, from Mansur, from Mujahid, from al-Hakam ibn Sufyan, or Sufyan ibn al-Hakam. Abd al-Rahman said in his hadith: I saw the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) urinate and perform ablution and sprinkle his private part with water. Yahya said in his hadith: The Prophet (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) urinated and sprinkled."
"17765","Al-Aswad ibn Amir narrated to us, Sharik narrated to us who said: I asked the family of al-Hakam ibn Sufyan, and they mentioned that he did not meet the Prophet (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him)."
"17766","Abu Abd al-Rahman said: Shuba and Wuhayb narrated it, from Mansur, from Mujahid, from al-Hakam ibn Sufyan, from his father, that he saw the Prophet (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him). And others than them said: from Mansur, from Mujahid, from al-Hakam ibn Sufyan who said: I saw the Prophet (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him)."
